# SCORVE — Luxury Fashion Experience

SCORVE is a modern luxury fashion website designed to deliver an elegant and stylish online shopping experience. Built with a premium black and gold visual identity, the website brings together fashion collections, luxury accessories, and refined design.

The project focuses on responsive layouts, interactive product browsing, and a visually engaging fashion experience across desktop and mobile devices.

## About the Project

SCORVE is designed for users who appreciate modern fashion, timeless elegance, and premium aesthetics. The website combines a sophisticated interface with useful shopping features to make exploring collections simple and enjoyable.

## Key Features

### 1. Home Page

- Luxury-themed landing page
- Hero section with fashion visuals
- New Collection and Most Wanted sections
- Explore by Video section
- Navigation to different website pages

### 2. Product Collection

- Dedicated product listing page
- Multiple fashion and lifestyle categories
- Product cards with images, names, and prices
- Search products by keyword
- Filter products by category, gender, and colour
- Sort products by price from low to high or high to low
- Clear Filters option

### 3. Fashion Categories

- Old Money Casual Outfits
- Luxury Dresses
- Perfumes
- Bags
- Jewellery

### 4. Explore by Video

- Fashion videos showcasing collections
- Video controls for browsing visual content
- Links to explore and shop products

### 5. Contact Page

- Dedicated contact page
- Easy navigation between website sections

### 6. Responsive Design

- Desktop and mobile-friendly layouts
- Responsive navigation menu
- Adaptable product and video sections

## Technologies Used

- **HTML5** — Website structure and content
- **CSS3** — Styling, layouts, animations, and responsive design
- **JavaScript** — Product rendering, search, filtering, sorting, and interactive elements

## Design Concept

SCORVE follows a luxury-inspired visual direction using black, gold, and complementary neutral tones. The design aims to create a sophisticated fashion identity with clean layouts, elegant typography, and visually focused product presentation.

